{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your own team and go from championship to championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the eye of a supplier and become a factory team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your team by developing your headquarters, hiring talented drivers and designers and getting better sponsor deals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire the best designers right away or try to develop their skills over the seasons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own parts or get them from a supplier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tradeoffs will see you succeed or fail over the course of a season.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch long-term projects to achieve a leap in performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT TO REGULATION CHANGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start working on the next generation race pod in advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure the deal you make with a supplier will not bite you in the back upon a new regulation change a few seasons later.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOP YOUR OWN DRIVER ACADEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let new drivers gain experience in lower championships and then promote them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVEST IN INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your headquarters for better R&amp;D, performance and weather forecasting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOCUS ON YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is more about developping your team than managing races. You will have the opportunity to adjust some strategy elements before a race but you will not micromanage it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOTS PLAY BY THE RULES</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion (constructors)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/074f0e6c17ac91ecfa09a98f18436714094c0291.jpg"},{"name":"Champion (drivers)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/60509f035e23f52b961dc18e48db07ab6f2ad86c.jpg"},{"name":"Season crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/7bd6059e2c22b0cd2b5d7382faa96e84f92c84c0.jpg"},{"name":"1, 2, 3 and 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/34df5ef1916f85fa108cabbd0464409594245776.jpg"},{"name":"A special career","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/c040e14f6c17fdc2cdde6613db5a4c0684b36b9c.jpg"},{"name":"Independence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/51b7ac27f96ff293836b17bb38f9e5a7ee14d149.jpg"},{"name":"Record holder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/c991382546e6dea14caaee728550dc1bd4958308.jpg"},{"name":"Record breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/9a8a046f091c77afa49e68db415bc0ffb807feb0.jpg"},{"name":"Longevity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/37a112993e2b352fb1710d20160f53c454017901.jpg"},{"name":"A legend is born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3026180/b3207c30bc4e570dce3886d90ee22854c6fbd7c2.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3026180?t=1749027976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3026180?t=1749027976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst